", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1246377433890655_1187504632366665546_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gGga7sz-y08Q7kNvwFdp_5Y&_nc_oc=AdpSAWpVPFf32p5sqxBpj8G66Dx-_V2AkwJ24-qFzsteykoy4-_OR3PSz6qZdLl_j60&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNoL-CXA0SGLywsCXqGicqeCebgFu6RJjnqtF2HcRZ9cg&oe=6AE4A257"}]}, "id": "1467575007826864", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "Screenshots1.png", "id": "982434117190171", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507833247_982434123856837_4166570607292282212_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aQMNIM-eGoAQ7kNvwHdXL6r&_nc_oc=AdopKLRC88oBuCLgqezFKxu3dUaEow5lhUyeGs3gq-arLaUyhn_UCKtezIZ4k2fphZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPuCmdoIr76A499kj0tjS9Nyyc_gxcK2OwSCjlYbR8IpQ&oe=6AE48994"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots2.png", "id": "722121720463623", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830615_722121723796956_1827050947745666925_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ewiQdHLVNpsQ7kNvwFa3qHF&_nc_oc=AdpGKQFMPxkN8trxS_QbAc7BeDOK77LrwS1PrMIQJUJpdmeY4ttwCEQVsL-ULznj-lA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOLI6rzTXpLPpJAn20TpY-hByT47aqbXJiopR8zW3bE-A&oe=6AE4BF60"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots5.png", "id": "1370323520706357", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507838221_1370323524039690_4225516602237080327_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RWAkqkxfjnMQ7kNvwEXoRWm&_nc_oc=AdrTs2pAkKMoqskoiMPvmHI3jEcL2vKAjX5sfZdREcN-7NJOIEsc0Po02DlA0HZObA4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPywft0FY4LIbvApdeEShic8nxTax89BydRzwYfSPhA6g&oe=6AE4ABCC"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots3.png", "id": "1041880324787442", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827282_1041880328120775_7204104652932295874_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FtI8Dd8kBl0Q7kNvwEP88y-&_nc_oc=AdryDwVfKZaiNKu_2QEdmVUiS1UCdfIUrnZ-8QfpExFLzpqakofO2SvRd6X4vgqCztA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPC0UM1_ZqTsWa9ku20MHnUYwkph54Lheuf-GUYJWhrNg&oe=6AE4AA90"}, {"file_name": "Screenshots4.png", "id": "750665607472399", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507838221_750665610805732_2746628426978505079_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-mPNi74ln5kQ7kNvwEGzSOx&_nc_oc=Adq1Q8LY_KScq2z8baRWlRlupiHa8HVS89bH20j5avWVspAo-kuR44vocSMlQaFM72Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOTnBjIgZ0cGFz5Mn2VSFULWkS3i2VE67tI3ULNknnYZA&oe=6AE4B467"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Holy Bible", "keywords": ["bible", "holy"], "long_description": "A modern and elegant Bible reading app that offers a complete reading experience with multiple Bible versions in English and Spanish.\n\n## **\ud83c\udf1f Key Features**\n\n### **\ud83d\udcda Multiple Bible Versions**\n\n#### **English Versions (9 available):**\n- **KJV** - King James Version\n- **KJV with Strong's** - King James Version with Strong's Numbers\n- **ASV** - American Standard Version  \n- **ASV with Strong's** - American Standard Version (Strongs)\n- **WEB** - World English Bible\n- **Bishops** - Bishops Bible\n- **Coverdale** - Coverdale Bible\n- **Geneva** - Geneva Bible\n- **Tyndale** - Tyndale Bible\n\n#### **Spanish Versions (6 available):**\n- **RVG** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez\n- **RVG 2004** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez 2004\n- **RV 1858** - Reina Valera 1858\n- **RV 1909** - Reina Valera 1909\n- **RV 1909 with Strong's** - Reina Valera 1909 (with Strong's Numbers)\n- **Sagradas** - Sagradas Escrituras\n\n### **\u2b50 Favorites System**\n- **Save Verses**: Add your favorite verses with one tap\n- **Copy Functionality**: Copy entire verses with reference and metadata", "short_description": "2D Holy Bible with several versions of books in English and Spanish."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1305413407437749", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Santa Biblia", "keywords": ["biblia"], "long_description": "Una aplicaci\u00f3n moderna y elegante para leer la Biblia que ofrece una experiencia completa con m\u00faltiples versiones en ingl\u00e9s y espa\u00f1ol.\n\n## **\ud83c\udf1f Caracter\u00edsticas principales**\n\n### **\ud83d\udcda M\u00faltiples versiones de la Biblia**\n\n#### **Versiones en ingl\u00e9s (9 disponibles):**\n- **KJV** - Versi\u00f3n King James\n- **KJV con Strong's** - Versi\u00f3n King James con n\u00fameros de Strong\n- **ASV** - Versi\u00f3n Est\u00e1ndar Americana\n- **ASV con Strong's** - Versi\u00f3n Est\u00e1ndar Americana (Strongs)\n- **WEB** - Biblia en ingl\u00e9s mundial\n- **Bishops** - Biblia Bishops\n- **Coverdale** - Biblia Coverdale\n- **Geneva** - Biblia de Ginebra\n- **Tyndale** - Biblia Tyndale\n\n#### **Versiones en espa\u00f1ol (6 disponibles):**\n- **RVG** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez\n- **RVG 2004** - Reina Valera G\u00f3mez 2004\n- **RV 1858** - Reina Valera 1858\n- **RV 1909** - Reina Valera 1909\n- **RV 1909 con Strong's** - Reina Valera 1909 (con n\u00fameros de Strong's)\n- **Sagradas** - Sagradas Escrituras\n\n### **\u2b50 Sistema de Favoritos**\n- **Guardar Vers\u00edculos**: Agrega tus vers\u00edculos favoritos con un solo toque\n- **Funcionalidad de Copiar**: Copia vers\u00edculos completos con referencia y metadatos", "short_description": "Santa Biblia 2D con varias versiones de libros en ingl\u00e9s y espa\u00f1ol."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Z2a9RVyaCRoT3SMOtdTwtKuFZSdIYrVVvKWwqAbRgEs/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Pop Software Developer", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/biblie-vr/inicio", "category": null, "comf